<title>USA: Inter-Continental Services wins contract.</title>
<headline>Inter-Continental Services wins contract.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter-Continental Services Corp said Tuesday it won a telecommunications services contract worth an estimated $45 million.</p>
<p>The 24-month contract with DTA Telecommunications Network LLC is the first of three pending deals between the two companies, Robert Meyer, Inter-Continental Services chairman and chief executive officer, said.</p>
<p>Inter-Continental Services provides credit and other services to commercial clients.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
